# Single .gitignore covering all three sub-projects in this repo:
#   /          - Node/TypeScript backend
#   frontend/  - Vite/React frontend (also has its own frontend/.gitignore)
#   service/   - ASP.NET Core PDM/SOLIDWORKS automation service

# Dependencies - regenerated with `npm install` in / and in frontend/
node_modules/

# Build output / IDE caches - regenerated with `npm run build:all` (/, frontend/)
# and `dotnet build` (service/). Matches at any depth, so this also covers
# frontend/dist/ and service/bin/, service/obj/ without separate entries.
dist/
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local SQLite databases - large, derived data regenerated from data_raw/ via the
# import scripts and scripts/syncProjects.ts, plus the manual backups made along the way.
*.db
*.db.bak-*

# --- Intentionally NOT ignored (do not add rules for these) ---
# credentials/        - test DB logins (credentials/creds, credentials/erp_creds) this
#                        project needs on every environment it runs on, including the
#                        test server this repo is being moved to. These are test
#                        credentials, not production secrets - see CLAUDE.md.
# service/lib/*.dll    - vendored SOLIDWORKS/EPDM COM interop assemblies. Not available
#                        via NuGet; service/bin and service/obj above only ignore the
#                        *build output* copies of these, never the lib/ originals.
!credentials/
!service/lib/
